## Scope — Documents Management Core

**Included in this release:**
- Manual task creation linked to a document (individual or role-group assignee)
- Metadata-based routing rules engine (practice-configured; no EMIS-supplied defaults)
- In-product disclaimer at point of rule creation
- Task trail visible on document
- Document blocked as done until all tasks complete

**Deferred to Phase 2:**
- User-defined group management (create and manage custom groups)
- Task reassignment with notification to original assignee
- Task trail permanence policy (pending V1e clinical safety review)
